{"page":122,"width":1767,"height":2768,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"176","words":[{"text":"176","x":168,"y":132,"width":62,"height":30}]},{"text":"4.1","words":[{"text":"4.1","x":166,"y":274,"width":84,"height":36}]},{"text":"Chapter 4 스레드와 병행성","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":309,"y":133,"width":127,"height":28},{"text":"4","x":451,"y":133,"width":23,"height":23},{"text":"스레드와","x":504,"y":133,"width":96,"height":26},{"text":"병행성","x":610,"y":131,"width":69,"height":28}]},{"text":"개요 Overview","words":[{"text":"개요","x":311,"y":268,"width":80,"height":37},{"text":"Overview","x":423,"y":277,"width":177,"height":27}]},{"text":"스레드는 CPU 이용의 기본 단위이다. 스레드는 스레드 ID, 표 로그램 기은터(PC), 레지","words":[{"text":"스레드는","x":309,"y":367,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"CPU","x":459,"y":369,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"이용의","x":555,"y":367,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"기본","x":667,"y":367,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"단위이다.","x":744,"y":368,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"스레드는","x":899,"y":368,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"스레드","x":1046,"y":369,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"ID,","x":1162,"y":373,"width":53,"height":35},{"text":"표","x":1236,"y":374,"width":26,"height":18},{"text":"로그램","x":1272,"y":372,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"기은터(PC),","x":1392,"y":372,"width":206,"height":41},{"text":"레지","x":1615,"y":374,"width":58,"height":42}]},{"text":"스터 집합, 그리고 스택으로 구성된다. 스레드는 같은 프로세스에 속한 다른 스레드와 코","words":[{"text":"스터","x":309,"y":430,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"집합,","x":392,"y":429,"width":74,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":481,"y":430,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"스택으로","x":594,"y":431,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"구성된다.","x":738,"y":432,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"스레드는","x":893,"y":431,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"같은","x":1040,"y":431,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1120,"y":432,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"속한","x":1311,"y":433,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1400,"y":434,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"스레드와","x":1488,"y":434,"width":148,"height":38},{"text":"코","x":1647,"y":442,"width":30,"height":30}]},{"text":"드, 데이터 섹션, 그리고 열린 파일이나 신호와 같은 운영체제 자원들을 공유한다. 전통","words":[{"text":"드,","x":308,"y":498,"width":43,"height":33},{"text":"데이터","x":369,"y":493,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"섹션,","x":486,"y":493,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"그리고","x":576,"y":494,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"열린","x":693,"y":494,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"파일이나","x":771,"y":494,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"신호와","x":918,"y":494,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"같은","x":1033,"y":494,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"운영체제","x":1114,"y":494,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"자원들을","x":1272,"y":494,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"공유한다.","x":1435,"y":496,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"전통","x":1616,"y":497,"width":61,"height":41}]},{"text":"적인 프로세스는 하나의 제어 스레드를 가지고 있다. 만일 프로세스가 다수의 제어 스레","words":[{"text":"적인","x":310,"y":556,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스는","x":390,"y":557,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":574,"y":557,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"제어","x":687,"y":557,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":765,"y":558,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"가지고","x":911,"y":557,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1026,"y":557,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"만일","x":1115,"y":557,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1199,"y":557,"width":183,"height":39},{"text":"다수의","x":1396,"y":558,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"제어","x":1526,"y":558,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"스레","x":1613,"y":561,"width":61,"height":41}]},{"text":"드를 가진다면, 프로세스는 동시에 하나 이상의 작업을 수행할 수 있다. 그림 4.1은 전통","words":[{"text":"드를","x":308,"y":621,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"가진다면,","x":391,"y":620,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스는","x":549,"y":621,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"동시에","x":726,"y":621,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"하나","x":839,"y":621,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"이상의","x":918,"y":620,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"작업을","x":1030,"y":620,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"수행할","x":1146,"y":620,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1267,"y":620,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1320,"y":621,"width":79,"height":37},{"text":"그림","x":1416,"y":620,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"4.1은","x":1506,"y":622,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"전통","x":1614,"y":623,"width":63,"height":39}]},{"text":"적인 단일 스레드 프로세스와 다중 스레드 프로세스의 차이점을 보여주고 있다.","words":[{"text":"적인","x":309,"y":682,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"단일","x":389,"y":683,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"스레드","x":469,"y":685,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스와","x":582,"y":684,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":760,"y":684,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"스레드","x":836,"y":684,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스의","x":948,"y":683,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"차이점을","x":1132,"y":683,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"보여주고","x":1288,"y":683,"width":148,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1453,"y":683,"width":81,"height":38}]},{"text":"4.1.1 동기 Motivation","words":[{"text":"4.1.1","x":307,"y":802,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"동기","x":459,"y":804,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"Motivation","x":548,"y":813,"width":158,"height":23}]},{"text":"현대의 컴퓨터와 모바일 기기에서 작동하는 거의 모든 소프트웨어 응-용-들은 다중 스레","words":[{"text":"현대의","x":307,"y":879,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"컴퓨터와","x":427,"y":881,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"모바일","x":574,"y":881,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"기기에서","x":689,"y":880,"width":127,"height":40},{"text":"작동하는","x":835,"y":880,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"거의","x":986,"y":880,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1068,"y":882,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"소프트웨어","x":1153,"y":879,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"응-용-들은","x":1350,"y":878,"width":153,"height":38},{"text":"다중","x":1520,"y":879,"width":76,"height":37},{"text":"스레","x":1612,"y":882,"width":63,"height":40}]},{"text":"드를 이용한다. 하나의 공정은 몇 개의 실행 흐름을 가진 독립적인 프로세스로 구현된다.","words":[{"text":"드를","x":305,"y":945,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"이용한다.","x":389,"y":944,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":544,"y":945,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"공정은","x":654,"y":945,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"몇","x":768,"y":944,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"개의","x":812,"y":944,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"실행","x":891,"y":944,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"흐름을","x":969,"y":944,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"가진","x":1085,"y":944,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"독립적인","x":1166,"y":943,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스로","x":1324,"y":942,"width":188,"height":38},{"text":"구현된다.","x":1526,"y":942,"width":150,"height":42}]},{"text":"아래에서는 나중 스레드 응용 프로그램의 몇 가지 예를 보여준다.","words":[{"text":"아래에서는","x":306,"y":1007,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"나중","x":488,"y":1009,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"스레드","x":566,"y":1009,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"응용","x":676,"y":1009,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램의","x":754,"y":1009,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"몇","x":936,"y":1008,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"가지","x":980,"y":1008,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1062,"y":1008,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"보여준다.","x":1142,"y":1007,"width":150,"height":39}]},{"text":"• 이미지 모음에서 사진 축소판을 만드는 -응용 프로그램은 별도의 스레드를 시용하여","words":[{"text":"•","x":328,"y":1115,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"이미지","x":370,"y":1105,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"모음에서","x":482,"y":1104,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"사진","x":629,"y":1105,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"축소판을","x":707,"y":1105,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"만드는","x":855,"y":1105,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"-응용","x":969,"y":1105,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램은","x":1052,"y":1105,"width":178,"height":37},{"text":"별도의","x":1246,"y":1102,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":1368,"y":1102,"width":152,"height":38},{"text":"시용하여","x":1536,"y":1102,"width":139,"height":44}]},{"text":"개별 이미지에서 축소판을 생성할수 있다.","words":[{"text":"개별","x":369,"y":1169,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"이미지에서","x":448,"y":1169,"width":161,"height":39},{"text":"축소판을","x":624,"y":1169,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"생성할수","x":769,"y":1169,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":930,"y":1169,"width":72,"height":39}]},{"text":"• 웹 브라우저는 하나의 스레드가 이미지 또는 텍스트를 표시하고 다른 스레드는 네트","words":[{"text":"•","x":325,"y":1256,"width":15,"height":14},{"text":"웹","x":367,"y":1245,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"브라우저는","x":411,"y":1244,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":591,"y":1244,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"스레드가","x":701,"y":1244,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"이미지","x":849,"y":1244,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"또는","x":962,"y":1246,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"텍스트를","x":1044,"y":1244,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"표시하고","x":1197,"y":1243,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1356,"y":1241,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"스레드는","x":1444,"y":1240,"width":153,"height":39},{"text":"네트","x":1612,"y":1242,"width":65,"height":37}]},{"text":"워크에서 데이터를 검색하도록 할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"워크에서","x":366,"y":1310,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"데이터를","x":512,"y":1309,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"검색하도록","x":657,"y":1309,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"할","x":834,"y":1309,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":879,"y":1309,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":929,"y":1307,"width":72,"height":39}]},{"text":"• 워드 프로세서에는 그래픽을 표시하는 스레드, 사용자의 카 입력에 응답하는 또 다","words":[{"text":"•","x":323,"y":1395,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"워드","x":364,"y":1385,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"프로세서에는","x":446,"y":1385,"width":200,"height":39},{"text":"그래픽을","x":659,"y":1384,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"표시하는","x":808,"y":1383,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"스레드,","x":958,"y":1381,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"사용자의","x":1087,"y":1381,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"카","x":1246,"y":1381,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"입력에","x":1299,"y":1379,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"응답하는","x":1424,"y":1378,"width":154,"height":39},{"text":"또","x":1593,"y":1383,"width":37,"height":27},{"text":"다","x":1646,"y":1382,"width":32,"height":39}]},{"t